    "created_at": "2016-02-02T15:40:44Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-02-02T15:40:44Z",
    "body": "How is this implemented in Chrome and Firefox? Presumably there's no special casing of `<details>` or `<summary>`, but there's simply some default style that yields this computed style and layout?\n\n@upsuper @bzbarsky \n",
